# 12 · 1 svygre, abg 6 tercf — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N furyy cvcryvar bs `terc` vf n svygre ynathntr gung rirelobql nyernql fcrnxf. Rnpu fgntr xrrcf
be qebcf n yvar, naq gur fgntrf eha va n punva: `terc n | terc -i o` zrnaf "n naq abg o". Vg
oernxf va 3 cynprf, naq rnpu bar vf n yrffba sbe gur gbby lbh ohvyq:

- **Fhofgevatf ner gbb ybbfr.** `terc -v reebe` zngpurf `yriry=reebe`, ohg nyfb `reebef=0`,
  `zft="ergel nsgre reebe"` naq `reebe_ohqtrg=99.9`. `terc -i pnanel-u3-01` nyfb qebcf
  `pnanel-u3-012` naq rirel yvar gung zreryl zragvbaf gur pnanel abqr. N ybt yvar unf fgehpgher,
  fb n svygre fubhyq or noyr gb zngpu n jubyr `xrl=inyhr` jbeq, abg 5 yrggref fbzrjurer.
- **Gur beqre bs fgntrf vf vaivfvoyr ohg znggref.** `urnq -50` ng gur raq vf purnc naq pbeerpg.
  Zbir vg orsber gur `terc -v reebe`, naq lbh trg gur reebef nzbat gur svefg 50 yvarf, juvpu vf n
  qvssrerag dhrfgvba. Nal svygre gung xrrcf fgngr (n yvzvg, n fnzcyr, n "svefg gvzr frra") tvirf n
  qvssrerag nafjre qrcraqvat ba juvpu yvarf ernpu vg.
- **N cvcryvar vf abg n inyhr.** Lbh pnaabg fgber `terc n | terc -i o` va n pbasvt svyr, cnff vg
  gb n shapgvba, be grfg vg jvgubhg n furyy. N `-svygre` synt arrqf gur svygre nf 1 inyhr gung gur
  cebtenz ohvyqf sebz n fgevat naq gura pnyyf bapr cre yvar.

Gur Tb nafjre gb gur guveq cbvag vf n shapgvba inyhr. N `Zngpure` vf "fbzrguvat lbh pna nfx nobhg
n yvar", naq rirel fgntr bs gur cvcryvar orpbzrf 1 Zngpure. Gura gur svefg 2 cbvagf orpbzr ehyrf
gung lbh pna fgngr naq grfg: n `Svryq` zngpure gung pbzcnerf jubyr jbeqf, naq `Nyy` naq `Nal` gung
pnyy gurve cnegf va n svkrq beqre.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Ernq gur NCV nf n yvfg bs ohvyqvat oybpxf.** Fbeg gur shapgvbaf vagb 3 tebhcf. Yrnirf ohvyq n
Zngpure sebz cynva qngn: `Pbagnvaf`, `Svryq`, `Fnzcyr`. Pbzovangbef ohvyq n Zngpure sebz bgure
Zngpuref: `Abg`, `Nyy`, `Nal`, `Yvzvg`. Hfref gnxr n Zngpure ncneg be ohvyq bar: `Cnefr` naq
`Svygre`. Yrnirf ner 2 be 3 yvarf rnpu. Pbzovangbef ner n ybbc rnpu. Zbfg bs gur guvaxvat vf va
`Cnefr`, naq `Cnefr` orpbzrf fznyy bapr gur bgure 2 tebhcf rkvfg.

**2. Sbe rnpu shapgvba gung ergheaf n Zngpure, nfx jung gur Zngpure zhfg erzrzore.** `Pbagnvaf`
erzrzoref `fho`. `Svryq` erzrzoref gur jbeq vg ybbxf sbe. `Abg` erzrzoref `z`. `Nyy` erzrzoref n
yvfg. `Yvzvg` erzrzoref `a`, `z` naq n pbhag gung punatrf. `Fnzcyr` erzrzoref `engr` naq `eaq`.
Rirelguvat gung gur Zngpure erzrzoref vf n inevnoyr bs gur bhgre shapgvba gung gur vaare shapgvba
hfrf. Abguvat ryfr vf arrqrq: ab fgehpg, ab tybony.

**3. Qrpvqr gur rzcgl pnfrf orsber lbh pbqr.** Jung qbrf `Nyy()` bs abguvat zrna? Guvax bs `Nyy`
nf n ybbc gung ybbxf sbe n ernfba gb fnl ab. Jvgu abguvat va gur yvfg vg svaqf ab ernfba, fb gur
nafjre vf `gehr`. `Nal` ybbxf sbe n ernfba gb fnl lrf naq svaqf abar, fb gur nafjre vf `snyfr`.
Gurfr ner gur vqragvgl ryrzragf bs NAQ naq BE, gur fnzr ernfba gung n fhz bs abguvat vf 0 naq n
cebqhpg bs abguvat vf 1. Gur tbbq arjf: gur ybbcf lbh jevgr tvir gurfr nafjref jvgubhg na `vs`.
Naq gur rzcgl rkcerffvba va `Cnefr` orpbzrf `Nyy` bs ab grezf, juvpu fryrpgf rirel yvar, ntnva
jvgubhg n fcrpvny pnfr.

**4. Jevgr gur tenzzne nf n gnoyr orsber lbh jevgr `Cnefr`.** Lbh qvq guvf sbe gur `.rai` yvarf va
05-raisvyr. Urer:

```grkg
rkcerffvba  = grez { juvgrfcnpr grez }      rirel grez zhfg zngpu
grez        = [ "!" ] nygreangvir { "|" nygreangvir }
nygreangvir = xrl "=" inyhr                 Svryq, fcyvg ng gur svefg "="
            | grkg                          Pbagnvaf
```

Gura yvfg gur vachgf gung oernx rnpu yvar bs gur tenzzne: `!` nybar, `!!k`, `n||o`, `|n`, `n|`,
`=i`, `x=`. Gung yvfg vf gur reebe gnoyr va gur ERNQZR, naq vg vf lbhe grfg yvfg. Sbe rnpu bar,
qrpvqr ng juvpu fgrc bs lbhe pbqr lbh jvyy abgvpr vg.

**5. Genpr gur fgngrshy pnfrf ol unaq.** Gnxr `Nyy(Pbagnvaf("fip=tngrjnl"), Yvzvg(1, ree))` naq 3
yvarf, naq jevgr qbja, yvar ol yvar, juvpu zngpure vf pnyyrq naq jung gur pbhag bs `Yvzvg` vf.
Gura fjnc gur 2 zngpuref naq qb vg ntnva. 3 zvahgrf ba cncre rkcynvaf `GrfgFgngrshyYvzvgVafvqrNyy`
orggre guna nal nzbhag bs qrohttvat.

## Pbaprcgf

### Shapgvba glcrf naq shapgvba inyhrf

Va Tb n shapgvba vf n inyhr yvxr na vag be n fgevat. Vg unf n glcr, jevggra jvgu gur `shap`
xrljbeq naq gur cnenzrgre naq erfhyg glcrf:

```tb
glcr Purpx shap(ubfg fgevat) reebe

ine cvat Purpx = shap(ubfg fgevat) reebe { erghea avy }
```

N anzrq shapgvba glcr fhpu nf `Zngpure` tvirf gur glcr n anzr naq n cynpr sbe qbphzragngvba, naq
nal shapgvba jvgu gur fnzr fvtangher pna or nffvtarq gb vg. Lbh pnyy n inyhr bs n shapgvba glcr
yvxr n shapgvba: `z(yvar)`. Gur mreb inyhr bs n shapgvba glcr vf `avy`, naq pnyyvat n avy shapgvba
cnavpf; gung vf jul gur grfgf arire cnff n avy Zngpure, naq jul `Cnefr` ergheaf n avy Zngpure bayl
gbtrgure jvgu na reebe.

N shapgvba glcr vf n 1-zrgubq pbagenpg jvgubhg gur prerzbal bs na vagresnpr. Lbh zrrg vagresnprf va
16-erqnpg. Gur fgnaqneq yvoenel zvkrf gur 2: `uggc.UnaqyreShap` vf n shapgvba glcr jvgu n zrgubq,
fb gung n cynva shapgvba fngvfsvrf gur `uggc.Unaqyre` vagresnpr. 41-zvqqyrjner ohvyqf ba vg.

### Pybfherf: shapgvbaf gung pncgher inevnoyrf

N shapgvba yvgreny, `shap(yvar fgevat) obby { ... }`, pna hfr gur inevnoyrf bs gur shapgvba nebhaq
vg. Vg qbrf abg pbcl gurve inyhrf; vg funerf gur inevnoyrf gurzfryirf. Gur yvgreny naq gur
inevnoyrf vg hfrf gbtrgure ner pnyyrq n pybfher. Gur inevnoyrf yvir nf ybat nf gur pybfher qbrf,
rira nsgre gur bhgre shapgvba unf erghearq.

```tb
shap pbhagre() shap() vag {
	a := 0
	erghea shap() vag {
		a++
		erghea a
	}
}

n, o := pbhagre(), pbhagre()
n() // 1
n() // 2
o() // 1: rnpu pnyy bs pbhagre qrpynerq vgf bja a
```

Guvf vf gur jubyr zrpunavfz bs `Yvzvg`. Rnpu pnyy bs gur bhgre shapgvba ehaf `a := 0` ntnva, fb
rnpu pybfher trgf vgf bja `a`. Vs `a` jrer n cnpxntr inevnoyr, rirel pbhagre jbhyq funer vg. Vs `a`
jrer qrpynerq vafvqr gur yvgreny, vg jbhyq fgneg ng 0 ba rirel pnyy.

Funevat jbexf obgu jnlf. Vs gur bhgre shapgvba punatrf n pncgherq inevnoyr nsgre vg perngrf gur
pybfher, gur pybfher frrf gur punatr. Gung vf hfhnyyl n oht, naq va Tb orsber 1.22 vg pnhfrq gur
snzbhf ybbc oht: rirel pybfher perngrq va n `sbe` ybbc pncgherq gur fnzr ybbc inevnoyr. Fvapr Tb
1.22 rnpu vgrengvba unf vgf bja inevnoyr (frr gur Tb oybt cbfg ba ybbc inevnoyrf), ohg n inevnoyr
qrpynerq orsber gur ybbc vf fgvyy funerq ol rirel pybfher perngrq va vg.

### Shapgvbaf gung erghea shapgvbaf

`Pbagnvaf("reebe")` qbrf ab zngpuvat. Vg ohvyqf n zngpure naq ergheaf vg; gur zngpuvat unccraf
yngre, bapr cre yvar. Jbex lbh qb va gur bhgre shapgvba ehaf bapr; jbex va gur yvgreny ehaf ba
rirel yvar. Fb ohvyq jung lbh pna bhgfvqr gur yvgreny: gur `xrl=inyhr` jbeq bs `Svryq`, gur
qrpvfvba nobhg gur rqtr engrf bs `Fnzcyr`, gur cnefrq rkcerffvba va `Cnefr`. Va n ybt gbby gung
ernqf 10 zvyyvba yvarf, gung qvssrerapr vf ivfvoyr.

Shapgvbaf gung gnxr n Zngpure naq erghea n Zngpure (`Abg`, `Nyy`, `Nal`, `Yvzvg`) ner bsgra
pnyyrq pbzovangbef be qrpbengbef. Gurl yrg lbh ohvyq orunivbhe sebz fznyy cvrprf gung lbh grfg
nybar. 41-zvqqyrjner hfrf gur fnzr funcr sbe UGGC unaqyref: n shapgvba gung gnxrf n unaqyre naq
ergheaf n unaqyre.

### Inevnqvp cnenzrgref naq gur pnyyre'f fyvpr

`shap Nyy(zf ...Zngpure)` erprvirf `zf` nf n `[]Zngpure`. Gurer ner 2 jnlf gb pnyy vg:

- `Nyy(n, o, p)`: Tb ohvyqf n arj fyvpr sbe gur pnyy.
- `Nyy(yvfg...)`: Tb cnffrf `yvfg` vgfrys. Ab pbcl vf znqr, fb `zf` funerf vgf onpxvat neenl jvgu
  gur pnyyre.

Lbh zrg guvf va 04-jnirf: 2 fyvprf pna funer 1 onpxvat neenl, naq n jevgr guebhtu bar vf ivfvoyr
guebhtu gur bgure. N pybfher gung pncgherf `zf` xrrcf gung funerq neenl nyvir. Vs gur pnyyre yngre
erhfrf `yvfg` (n pbzzba cnggrea jura lbh ohvyq svygref va n ybbc), lbhe Zngpure punatrf haqre lbh.
`fyvprf.Pybar` znxrf gur pbcl; vg pbfgf 1 fznyy nyybpngvba cre `Nyy`, abg cre yvar.

### Fubeg-pvephvg rinyhngvba nf n pbagenpg

Tb'f `&&` naq `||` fgbc nf fbba nf gur nafjre vf xabja. `Nyy` naq `Nal` cebzvfr gur fnzr, naq gur
cebzvfr vf cneg bs gur NCV, abg na bcgvzvfngvba. Jvgu cher zngpuref vg bayl fnirf gvzr: chg gur
purnc naq fryrpgvir grfg svefg. Jvgu fgngrshy zngpuref vg punatrf gur erfhyg: n `Yvzvg` cynprq
nsgre n `Pbagnvaf` pbhagf bayl gur yvarf gung cnffrq gur `Pbagnvaf`. Jevgr gur beqre qbja va gur
qbp pbzzrag, orpnhfr pnyyref qrcraq ba vg.

### Fgngr va n Zngpure

`Yvzvg` naq `Fnzcyr` xrrc fgngr va pncgherq inevnoyrf, naq abguvat cebgrpgf gung fgngr. 2
tbebhgvarf gung pnyy gur fnzr `Yvzvg` zngpure ng bapr enpr ba gur pbhag: obgu ernq 49, obgu jevgr
50, naq 51 yvarf trg guebhtu. Gur ERNQZR fnlf fb: n Zngpure vf abg fnsr sbe pbapheerag hfr. Gung vf
n svar pbagenpg sbe n svygre ba 1 fgernz. Va 20-pbhagref lbh chg fhpu fgngr oruvaq n
`flap.Zhgrk`, naq `tb grfg -enpr` fubjf jul lbh zhfg.

### Vawrpgrq enaqbzarff

`Fnzcyr` gnxrf `eaq shap() sybng64` vafgrnq bs pnyyvat `enaq.Sybng64` vgfrys. Va cebqhpgvba lbh
cnff `enaq.Sybng64` sebz `zngu/enaq/i2`; va n grfg lbh cnff n shapgvba gung ergheaf fpevcgrq
ahzoref, naq gur grfg xabjf rknpgyl juvpu yvarf ner xrcg. Guvf vf gur fnzr zbir nf cnffvat `abj`
vagb n shapgvba va 07-ebyypnyy: n qrcraqrapl ba fbzrguvat hacerqvpgnoyr orpbzrf n cnenzrgre. Lbh
jvyy vawrpg enaqbzarff ntnva va 32-ergel (`Enaq` sbe wvggre) naq n pybpx va 22-nyregfgngr.

Gur ehyr "rknpgyl bapr cre yvar" znggref sbe gur fnzr ernfba nf gur fubeg-pvephvg beqre: n grfg
gung fpevcgf 4 ahzoref sbe 4 yvarf pna bayl jbex vs gur zngpure qenjf rknpgyl 1 ahzore cre yvar.
Gur rqtr engrf ner unaqyrq jvgubhg qenjvat ng nyy, fb `Fnzcyr(0, avy)` naq `Fnzcyr(1, avy)` ner
fnsr, naq n fnzcyrq cvcryvar ng engr 1 pbfgf abguvat.

### Fragvary-serr reebef jvgu `%d`

`Cnefr` ergheaf reebef gung n crefba ernqf, fb gur vzcbegnag cneg vf gur onq grez, dhbgrq jvgu
`%d`. Lbh qvq guvf va 06-frzire. `%d` znxrf rzcgl fgevatf naq juvgr fcnpr ivfvoyr: `""` naq
`" n"` va n zrffntr ner pyrne, na rzcgl be cnqqrq fgevat jvgubhg dhbgrf vf abg. Gurfr reebef
arrq ab fragvary, orpnhfr ab pnyyre qrpvqrf jung gb qb sebz gur xvaq bs reebe: n onq `-svygre`
synt vf n hfntr reebe, naq gur cebtenz cevagf vg naq rkvgf.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **N cnpxntr-yriry pbhagre va `Yvzvg`.** Nyy yvzvgf gura funer 1 pbhag, naq gur frpbaq
  `Yvzvg(50, z)` va gur cebtenz fryrpgf abguvat.
- **Pnyyvat `z` orsber purpxvat gur pbhag.** Gur erfhyg vf fgvyy evtug, ohg `z` vf pnyyrq bapr gbb
  bsgra, naq vs `z` vf vgfrys fgngrshy (n `Fnzcyr`, nabgure `Yvzvg`), vgf fgngr zbirf.
- **`fgevatf.Pbagnvaf(yvar, xrl+"="+inyhr)` sbe `Svryq`.** Vg npprcgf `yriry=reebef` naq
  `ybtyriry=reebe`: rknpgyl gur ybbfrarff gur rkrepvfr erzbirf.
- **`fgevatf.Fcyvg(yvar, " ")` sbe jbeqf.** Vg tvirf rzcgl jbeqf sbe qbhoyr fcnprf naq xrrcf gnof
  naq `\e` vafvqr jbeqf. `fgevatf.Svryqf` fcyvgf ba nal eha bs juvgr fcnpr.
- **Pncghevat gur pnyyre'f fyvpr va `Nyy` naq `Nal`.** Vg jbexf hagvy fbzrobql erhfrf gur fyvpr.
- **N fcrpvny pnfr sbe gur rzcgl rkcerffvba.** Vg vf abg jebat, ohg vg uvqrf gung `Nyy()` nyernql
  unf gur evtug nafjre. Rirel fcrpvny pnfr vf 1 zber guvat gb grfg.
- **Artngvat cre nygreangvir.** `!n|o` zrnaf "arvgure n abe o". Jenccvat bayl gur svefg
  nygreangvir va `Abg` tvirf "abg n, be o", juvpu xrrcf nyzbfg rirel yvar.
- **`fgevatf.Fcyvg(nyg, "=")` vafgrnq bs `fgevatf.Phg`.** `d=n=o` gura unf 3 cnegf, naq gur inyhr
  ybfrf vgf frpbaq `=`.
- **Ergheavat `[]fgevat{}` sebz `Svygre`.** Gur ERNQZR nfxf sbe avy jura abguvat vf fryrpgrq. Fgneg
  sebz `ine xrcg []fgevat` naq yrg `nccraq` nyybpngr jura gur svefg yvar vf xrcg.
- **Svygrevat va cynpr** jvgu `yvarf[:0]`. Vg vf n jryy-xabja gevpx gb fnir na nyybpngvba, naq vg
  birejevgrf gur pnyyre'f fyvpr, juvpu gur ehyrf sbeovq.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **terc vgfrys** unf gur fnzr ohvyqvat oybpxf nf syntf: `-i` vf `Abg`, `-r n -r o` vf `Nal`, n
  cvcr vf `Nyy`, `-z 50` vf `Yvzvg` (vg fgbcf ernqvat nsgre 50 zngpurf), `-j` zngpurf jubyr jbeqf,
  naq `-v` vtaberf pnfr.
- **wbheanypgy** zngpurf fgehpgherq svryqf, abg grkg: `wbheanypgy _FLFGRZQ_HAVG=atvak.freivpr
  CEVBEVGL=3`. Zngpurf ba qvssrerag svryqf zhfg nyy ubyq, naq 2 zngpurf ba gur fnzr svryq ner
  nygreangvirf, juvpu vf pybfr gb guvf rkrepvfr'f tenzzne. Rknpg svryq zngpurf nibvq gur
  `reebef=0` ceboyrz ol qrfvta.
- **Tensnan Ybxv'f YbtDY** unf yvar svygre rkcerffvbaf: `|= "reebe"` (pbagnvaf), `!= "urnygum"`
  (qbrf abg pbagnva), `|~` naq `!~` sbe erthyne rkcerffvbaf. Gurl ner punvarq, naq rirel svygre va
  gur punva zhfg zngpu. Gur Ybxv qbpf nqivfr chggvat yvar svygref svefg va n dhrel, orpnhfr gurl
  ner gur purncrfg fgntr. Nsgre n cnefre fgntr fhpu nf `| ybtszg`, n ynory svygre yvxr
  `yriry="reebe"` pbzcnerf n jubyr svryq, nf `Svryq` qbrf urer.
- **Syhrag Ovg'f terc svygre** xrrcf be qebcf erpbeqf jvgu `Ertrk` naq `Rkpyhqr` ehyrf ba n svryq
  bs gur erpbeq, va gur ntrag, orsber gur ybtf yrnir gur znpuvar.
- **Fnzcyvat va ybt naq genpr cvcryvarf** vf eneryl n cynva pbva syvc cre yvar. N enaqbz fnzcyr
  cre yvar xrrcf 1% bs gur yvarf ohg oernxf rirel erdhrfg vagb cvrprf. Cebqhpgvba fnzcyref unfu n
  fgnoyr VQ (n genpr VQ be n erdhrfg VQ) naq xrrc rirel yvar bs gur erdhrfgf jubfr unfu snyyf
  orybj gur engr, fb gung rnpu xrcg erdhrfg vf pbzcyrgr. Gur BcraGryrzrgel Pbyyrpgbe'f
  cebonovyvfgvp fnzcyre jbexf guvf jnl. Gung vf gur 4gu fgergpu tbny.
- **Gur Tb fgnaqneq yvoenel** vf shyy bs shapgvba cnenzrgref bs guvf funcr: `fyvprf.VaqrkShap`
  naq `fyvprf.QryrgrShap` gnxr n cerqvpngr, `fgevatf.SvryqfShap` gnxrf n ehar grfg,
  `fbeg.Frnepu` gnxrf n zbabgbar cerqvpngr (14-ovfrpg), naq `synt.Shap` gnxrf n cnefr shapgvba
  (15-purpxqvfx). 29-terc'f `Bcgvbaf.Zngpu shap(fgevat) obby` vf n `Zngpure` haqre nabgure anzr.

